// Security log cleared (event 1102), for Microsoft Sentinel.
// Not run against a live workspace.
//
// Why this is hand-written: as with the ESENT rule, the Sigma rule targets a Windows
// event log channel that Defender XDR does not expose as a table, so it does not
// convert to KQL. Sentinel keeps Security events in SecurityEvent.
SecurityEvent
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| where EventID == 1102
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, Activity
